</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="ln">16</span><span class="cl"><span class="w">      </span>- --<span class="l">console-address &#34;:41863&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1 id="安装-minio">安装 minIO</h1>
